WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.599 --> 00:00:04.640
Sex is the foundation of life.

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:11.270
It is at the root of our nature and our lives
are in constant motion towards it.

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:18.590
Every component of life works to ensure the
survival and advancement of life itself.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:25.550
Sex is arguably the most powerful component
as it is the means in which life perpetuates

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:30.140
and fights for the collective state of existence.

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:36.079
But what implications does the force of sex
have on our conscious and human experience

00:00:36.079 --> 00:00:37.200
of life?

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:43.579
As humans, we seek and require more than just
physical, sexual relationships.

00:00:43.579 --> 00:00:46.940
We want depth and connection.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:48.449
We want love.

00:00:48.449 --> 00:00:55.460
But while we are all aware of this and hope
to fulfill our conscious goals of connection

00:00:55.460 --> 00:01:03.910
and love, the biological survival force of
sex works to deprives us of these goals.

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:11.510
This force controls our unconscious minds
and pushes us towards sex with lots of strangers,

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:16.720
and away from genuine connection and intimacy.

00:01:16.720 --> 00:01:23.890
The urge and curiosity for sexual adventure
and variety is constantly lingering inside

00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:27.600
of us, prodding for attention.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:30.270
So how should we deal with it?

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:37.600
If we break our sexuality down, we can separate
its goals into two categories.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:40.210
Love and lust.

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:42.399
Love being our conscious goal.

00:01:42.399 --> 00:01:48.049
And lust being our unconscious biological
one.

00:01:48.049 --> 00:01:51.570
We want to satisfy both… and we can.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:55.880
But only when a particular order and process
is followed.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:02:03.289
Otherwise, we will constantly run back and
forth between the two and never truly achieve

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:06.179
either.

00:02:06.179 --> 00:02:12.480
Lust comes easier than love, but that does
not make it more important.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:16.970
Lust is hollow when it is not filled by love.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:19.160
Lust is needy and greedy.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:25.580
It wants all of our attention and cares for
nothing other than itself.

00:02:25.580 --> 00:02:30.420
When we chase lust, we are forced to neglect
love.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:39.290
When we succumb to lust, we become attracted
to everyone and as a result, not REALLY anyone.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:42.350
We will never find love through lust.

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:48.770
We may pretend that we have, but we would
be lying to our self.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:56.060
Lust almost always alludes to feelings of
love, but does not always ensure it.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:03:01.810
The yearning of survival and reproduction
that drives us to want to have sex with as

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:11.680
many people as possible relies on the circularity
of sex; anticipation-action-pleasure-emptiness-repeat.

00:03:11.680 --> 00:03:20.180
And somewhere within this cycle, we are expecting
to find love.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.480
But it is not there.

00:03:22.480 --> 00:03:29.320
Lust does not care about love or the various
aspirations of humankind.

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:35.770
Confusing lust with love is why there is often
so much conflict and failure in relationships

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:38.110
and marriages.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:42.730
As humans, we are an overpopulated species.

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:47.420
So maintaining existence is no longer the
issue at hand.

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:54.120
Therefore, our sexual nature warrants partially
useless results.

00:03:54.120 --> 00:04:01.430
As willful beings, we have the power to examine
and understand this and determine how we wish

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:08.510
to recalibrate our actions to better fit a
balanced and fulfilling life.

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:15.230
The real problem humanity is facing is not
population or survival.

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:17.130
It is lack of love.

00:04:17.130 --> 00:04:18.850
Lack of connection.

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:21.160
Lack of happiness.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:25.680
The only way to love is through love itself.

00:04:25.680 --> 00:04:27.940
Love comes first.

00:04:27.940 --> 00:04:32.500
You must open yourself up to the love that
you posses.

00:04:32.500 --> 00:04:37.840
It is something within us all that is beyond
objectification.

00:04:37.840 --> 00:04:44.260
By embracing the unity between yourself and
the wrest of the world, love blossoms within

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:46.380
you.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:55.140
Love in a lustful and romantic sense may fleet,
but love in the sense of connection does not.

00:04:55.140 --> 00:05:02.930
As chemicals fluctuate in the brain and factors
of the world push and pull you out of romance,

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:07.310
you can still remain constantly with love.

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:15.170
When you maintain this, your love will manifest
into relationships that are strong and meaningful.

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:19.710
By seeking love through lust, you miss out
on love.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:35.460
But by seeking lust through love, you become
able to profoundly enjoy both.

